  "description": "After chatting with a flower shop’s mascot part-time worker, Do-Hui suddenly finds himself on the radar of the school delinquent, Yang-Hyeon. Seeking comfort, he confides in the gentle person inside the bear costume, never suspecting it’s actually Yang-Hyeon himself. As misunderstandings and hidden crushes collide, a shy first love begins to bloom in the most unexpected way. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
